              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none"><p class="font-display font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-widest text-white/75 text-center leading-relaxed drop-shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]">Колесо<br/>привычек<br/>клуба</p></div>
